  "body": "Discover the perfect blend of space, comfort and effortless indoor-outdoor living at 242A West Hoe Heights, Orewa.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 420sqm section with approximately 179sqm of floor area, this impressive home offers four spacious bedrooms and three bathrooms, making it an ideal choice for growing families, multi-generational living or those seeking extra room to spread out.\r\n\r\nDesigned for relaxed family living and entertaining, this home offers outdoor living spaces at both the front and rear. Enjoy the sunny front balcony, perfect for your morning coffee or soaking up the sunshine, while the spacious rear deck flows seamlessly to the backyard, creating an inviting setting for summer BBQs, weekend gatherings and quality time with family and friends.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\n* Generous 420sqm section\r\n* Approximately 179sqm floor area\r\n* 4 spacious bedrooms, 3 bathrooms including 1 master ensuite.\r\n* Sunny front balcony and spacious rear deck for versatile outdoor living\r\n* Seamless connection between the rear deck and backyard\r\n* Tandem double garage offering secure parking and additional storage potential\r\n* Ideal for growing families, entertaining and everyday comfort\r\n\r\nLocated in the popular coastal community of Orewa, this home offers a relaxed lifestyle with convenient access to local amenities, shops, cafes, schools and the beautiful Orewa Beach.\r\n\r\nSpace, sunshine and outdoor living - make this Orewa home yours!\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your viewing.",
